WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.680
Set a conventional oven to 175 degrees
Celsius or 350 Fahrenheit.

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.400
While it warms, lightly grease your pan,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.940
line the bottom with baking parchment,

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.500
and grease the paper.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.320
Wait for the oven's ready indicator before
baking.

